{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 44, :comments ["<b>And you shall be holy, for I am holy.</b> So that you may be holy and eternal by knowing your Creator and walking in His ways — and this is what I desire, in order that you become like Me, for I am holy. And all this you will attain when you sanctify yourselves and guard against forbidden foods, as they said, of blessed memory (Yoma 39a): If a person sanctifies himself a little, they sanctify him much, etc."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:36:05.434397444Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}